<title>KYRGYZSTAN: TABLE-Kyrgyz July consumer prices fall 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kyrgyz July consumer prices fall 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's consumer prices fell 1.2 percent in July after rising 0.7 percent in June, the National Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ CONSUMER PRICES	 July 97  June 97   July 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    -1.2     +0.7	-2.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +29.0    +29.2     +32.3</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
<p>e-mail: moscow.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
</text>
